{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f2b6c14-5f3f-4f2a-9a7c-supertonic0001",
    "name": "Supertonic Voice Clone \u2014 Batch API",
    "description": "Batch voice-style training and speech synthesis for supertonic3-voice-clone.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import `postman/supertonic-batch.postman_environment.json` and select it.\n2. Set `baseUrl` to your server (e.g. `https://<POD_ID>-8000.proxy.runpod.net`).\n3. Set `apiKey` if the server was started with `API_KEY`; leave blank otherwise.\n\n**Flow**\nRequests chain automatically: submitting a job saves `jobId`, submitting a batch saves `batchId`, uploading a voice saves `voiceId`, and a finished training job saves `styleId`. Run *Jobs \u2192 Get job* repeatedly (or use the Collection Runner) until `status` is `succeeded`, then *Jobs \u2192 Download result*.\n\nJobs run in parallel: the server has a pool of synthesis workers and a separate pool of training workers, so a long training run never blocks synthesis.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Skip the auth header entirely when no API key is configured,",
          "// so the collection works against an unauthenticated dev server.",
          "if (!pm.environment.get('apiKey') && !pm.collectionVariables.get('apiKey')) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.remove('X-API-Key');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "batchId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "voiceId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "styleId",
      "value": "F4",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
